//- The paid playtest, announced across the top of the page while applications
//- are open. Above the hero on purpose: it is the one thing on the site with
//- a deadline, and a visitor who is not ready to buy may be ready to be paid
//- to try. When PLAYTEST_OPEN is false the strip is not rendered at all.
mixin playtestStrip(study)
  .playtest-strip(data-screen-label="Paid playtest strip")
    .playtest-strip__inner
      span.playtest-strip__text
        strong Paid playtest:
        |  #{study.fee} for about #{study.totalMinutes} minutes on your Quest, #{study.places} places.
      a.playtest-strip__link(href="/playtest") Become a playtester →
